# Vercel Cron goes away with Vercel. Same schedule as astro-coach/vercel.json:
# 02:30 UTC = 08:00 IST.
#
# VPS / Compose: crontab -e, replace HOST and CRON_SECRET:
#
#   30 2 * * * curl -fsS -H "Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET" https://HOST/api/cron/notifications >/dev/null
#
# Railway: do NOT put a cronSchedule on the web service (that would stop Next).
# Add a second service in the same project:
#   Source: Docker image  curlimages/curl
#   Cron schedule:        30 2 * * *
#   Start command:        curl -fsS -H "Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET" "$NEXTAUTH_URL/api/cron/notifications"
# Copy CRON_SECRET and NEXTAUTH_URL from the web service variables.
# The cron service must exit after curl (Railway skips the next run if it stays Active).
